## Before you do anything in game

| Do | Why |
| --- | --- |
| Prefer **Edit** over **Debug** | Safer, cleaner changes |
| Work in the **breakroom** when creating or editing items | Prevents item duplication (`Teleport NPC` → `.Breakroom`) |
| Hit the **reload circle** in Spawn Anything | Ensures fresh spawns |
| **Duplicate** spawnables before taking them | Never take the original from the breakroom |
| Remove coins via **debug** (not dropped items) | Shows correctly in staff logs |

